sequenceDiagram
    participant A as User A
    participant B as User B
    participant S as Session Service
    participant O as Operation Processor
    A->>S: op(base_version=10)
    B->>S: op(base_version=10)
    S->>O: validate + transform A
    O-->>S: applied op v11
    S->>O: transform B against v11
    O-->>S: rebased op v12
    S-->>A: ack + v12 stream
    S-->>B: ack + v12 stream
